                        "entry_id": "ccad4631-019d-3e16-a74b-49033eb00df0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quantity analogous to electrical impedance in some other energy domain",
                            "the ratio of sound pressure to volume flow rate treated as complex quantities."
                        ],
